msgid ""
"Requires an authenticated active session, requests.start and request participant view "
"authorization. Returns the latest AI attempt per execution, ordered by creation time and ID; page"
" defaults to 1, size defaults to 20 and is bounded to 100. Exposes the historical agent pin, "
"available model identity, allowed input field names, typed recommendation and existing task "
"budget/unknown usage. No input values, prompt, checkpoint, raw response trace, secret, private "
"URL or connection credential is returned. Human outcomes remain in the authorized work-"
"item/process timeline. A normal/high-confidence recommendation never authorizes a protected "
"order; that requires the exact committed human approval. Missing historical agent metadata is "
"marked unavailable, never replaced with a latest agent. Missing/expired authentication returns "
"401, missing permission 403, outsider or wrong process 404, invalid pagination 422. This read "
"makes no model call. Deterministic tests are not live-model quality or calibration evidence."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Requires an authenticated active session, processes.recover and superuser recovery authorization."
" Supply current process and step execution refs, a 1–128 character command_key and a 1–64 "
"character incident reason code. Receipt lookup uses the original pinned publisher, connection, "
"credential version and operation identity; revoked authority or rotated pins fail closed. Never "
"sends another create request. UNKNOWN can be queried immediately; DISPATCHING must be at least 20"
" seconds old. A matching receipt confirms the existing operation and applies the ordinary "
"idempotent completion callback. Missing receipt remains UNKNOWN and does not authorize retry. "
"Same command and intent return current evidence even with old refs; changed intent conflicts. "
"Failed/uncertain lookup requires a fresh lookup command, never an effect replay. Errors: 401 "
"missing/expired session, 403 non-superuser, 404 wrong process/step, 409 stale refs, wrong state, "
"changed command intent or revoked pins, 422 invalid input, 503 unavailable lookup. No DB session "
"is held across HTTPS; no production purchase is made."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Requires an authenticated active session, processes.recover and superuser authorization. Supply "
"current process/step execution refs, command_key and an incident reason code. Requeues only a "
"previously dispatched sandbox reversal through the existing outbox/worker. The worker uses "
"receipt lookup with the original connection, credential and stable reversal identity; it never "
"resends cancellation or creates an order. Failed records are eligible immediately; EXECUTING "
"records must be at least 20 seconds old. Current publisher/grant/pin revocation fails closed. "
"RUNNING means queued, not provider-confirmed success. Inspect the ordinary process timeline for "
"compensation.receipt_confirmed and compensation.completed. Same command/intent returns current "
"state; changed intent conflicts. Errors: 401 missing authentication, 403 non-superuser, 404 wrong"
" process/step or missing reversal, 409 stale refs, revoked pins, changed intent or wrong state, "
"422 invalid input. A missing receipt remains failed/manual intervention; no blind effect replay "
"is permitted."
msgstr ""

