"authorization. Returns one latest attempt per sandbox order, ordered by step creation time and "
"ID. page defaults to 1; size defaults to 20 and is bounded to 100. PREPARED means staged, "
"DISPATCHING means a request may be in flight, UNKNOWN requires operator lookup, and CONFIRMED "
"includes an actual validated provider receipt. Queued does not mean completed. The opaque "
"step_execution_ref_id is current; operation_id is the stable external idempotency identity. No "
"inputs, approval records, credentials or private URLs are exposed. Outsiders receive 404; missing"
" permission receives 403. This inspection never dispatches an order."
